t is new:\n1. Create new project\n2. Work in the editor for a some hours\n3. Save, close and open this one\n4. Editor suddenly freezes after some minutes (even seconds).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCan be reproduced with an empty project (as I marked earlier)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105614/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}